# outside AppInbox is never implied and its code follows only the maintainer's approval, whoever merges. When an agent
# commits to or pushes the default branch, the review that happens is the one in the request AGENTS.md requires for a
# change to the registry file named below, which quotes that file's whole diff. A merge the maintainer performs in
# GitHub makes no such request; the pull request's own statement of writes outside AppInbox and its diff are then the
# record.
